OL,3,GNEWSAFirst acts revealed for folk
OL,4,Afestival's 30th event
OL,5,
OL,6,FFolk legend Richard Thompson, shanty
OL,7,Fgroup Fisherman's Friends and
OL,8,FAfrican-Afro Cuban pioneers Orchestra
OL,9,FBaobab are among the first acts
OL,10,Fannounced for the 30th edition of
OL,11,FShrewsbury Folk Festival.
OL,13,FThe four-day event, which began in
OL,14,FBridgnorth in 1997 with 700
OL,15,Ffestival-goers, will also celebrate 20
OL,16,Fyears at its current home at the West
OL,17,FMid Showground.
OL,19,FMore than a dozen other performers were
OL,20,Falso unveiled, with organisers
OL,21,Fpromising a mix of folk favourites, new
OL,22,Fdiscoveries and exclusive performances.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
