OL,3,GNEWSAFirst acts revealed for folk
OL,4,Afestival's 30th event
OL,5,
OL,6,FCreated by husband-and-wife team Alan
OL,7,FSurtees and Sandra Surtees, the
OL,8,Ffestival outgrew its original
OL,9,FBridgnorth site before moving to
OL,10,FShrewsbury in 2006 and settling at the
OL,11,Fshowground the next year.
